{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Hear us, Shepherd of|strong=\"H4210\"Israel,  \nyou who lead|strong=\"H5329\"Joseph like a|strong=\"H3068\"flock,  \nyou who sit above the|strong=\"H5329\"cherubim, shine out.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Before|strong=\"H3427\"Ephraim, Benjamin, and|strong=\"H3478\"Manasseh, stir up|strong=\"H7462\"your|strong=\"H7462\"might|strong=\"H3478\"!  \nCome|strong=\"H3478\"to|strong=\"H3478\"save us|strong=\"H3478\"!   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"Turn us|strong=\"H6440\"again|strong=\"H3212\", God.  \nCause your|strong=\"H6440\"face|strong=\"H6440\"to|strong=\"H3212\"shine,  \nand|strong=\"H3212\"we|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3444\"be|strong=\"H6440\"saved.   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"God of|strong=\"H6440\"Armies,  \nhow long|strong=\"H6440\"will|strong=\"H7725\"you|strong=\"H6440\"be|strong=\"H7725\"angry against|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"prayer of|strong=\"H6440\"your|strong=\"H6440\"people?   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"You|strong=\"H5704\"have|strong=\"H3068\"fed them|strong=\"H5704\"with|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"bread of|strong=\"H3068\"tears,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"given them|strong=\"H5704\"tears to|strong=\"H5704\"drink in|strong=\"H3068\"large measure.   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"You|strong=\"H1832\"make|strong=\"H8248\"us|strong=\"H8248\"a|strong=\"H3068\"source of|strong=\"H3899\"contention to|strong=\"H3899\"our|strong=\"H8248\"neighbors.  \nOur|strong=\"H8248\"enemies laugh among themselves.   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"Turn|strong=\"H7760\"us|strong=\"H7760\"again, God of|strong=\"H7760\"Armies.  \nCause your|strong=\"H7760\"face to|strong=\"H4066\"shine,  \nand|strong=\"H7760\"we|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H4066\"be|strong=\"H7760\"saved.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"You|strong=\"H6440\"brought|strong=\"H7725\"a|strong=\"H3068\"vine out|strong=\"H6440\"of|strong=\"H6440\"Egypt.  \nYou|strong=\"H6440\"drove out|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"nations|strong=\"H6440\", and|strong=\"H7725\"planted it|strong=\"H7725\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"You|strong=\"H4714\"cleared the|strong=\"H1644\"ground for|strong=\"H4714\"it|strong=\"H1644\".  \nIt|strong=\"H1644\"took|strong=\"H5265\"deep root, and|strong=\"H4714\"filled the|strong=\"H1644\"land.   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"The|strong=\"H6440\"mountains were|strong=\"H6440\"covered|strong=\"H4390\"with|strong=\"H4390\"its|strong=\"H4390\"shadow.  \nIts|strong=\"H4390\"boughs were|strong=\"H6440\"like|strong=\"H4390\"God’s cedars.   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"It|strong=\"H3680\"sent out its|strong=\"H3680\"branches|strong=\"H6057\"to|strong=\"H2022\"the|strong=\"H3680\"sea,  \nits|strong=\"H3680\"shoots to|strong=\"H2022\"the|strong=\"H3680\"River.   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"Why have|strong=\"H5104\"you|strong=\"H7971\"broken down|strong=\"H7971\"its|strong=\"H3220\"walls,  \nso|strong=\"H7971\"that|strong=\"H5704\"all|strong=\"H5704\"those who pass by|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H5704\"way|strong=\"H7971\"pluck it|strong=\"H5704\"?   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"boar out|strong=\"H6555\"of|strong=\"H1870\"the|strong=\"H3605\"wood ravages it|strong=\"H5674\".  \nThe|strong=\"H3605\"wild animals of|strong=\"H1870\"the|strong=\"H3605\"field feed on|strong=\"H5674\"it|strong=\"H5674\".   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"Turn again, we|strong=\"H3068\"beg you, God of|strong=\"H7704\"Armies.  \nLook down from|strong=\"H7704\"heaven, and|strong=\"H7704\"see, and|strong=\"H7704\"visit this vine,   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"the|strong=\"H7200\"stock which|strong=\"H6635\"your|strong=\"H7200\"right|strong=\"H5027\"hand planted,  \nthe|strong=\"H7200\"branch that|strong=\"H7200\"you|strong=\"H7725\"made|strong=\"H6485\"strong for|strong=\"H6635\"yourself.   \n"},{"number":16,"text":"It|strong=\"H5921\"’s burned with|strong=\"H5921\"fire.  \nIt|strong=\"H5921\"’s cut down|strong=\"H5921\".  \nThey|strong=\"H5921\"perish at|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"rebuke.   \n"},{"number":17,"text":"Let your|strong=\"H6440\"hand be|strong=\"H6440\"on|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"man|strong=\"H6440\"of|strong=\"H6440\"your|strong=\"H6440\"right hand,  \non|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"son of|strong=\"H6440\"man|strong=\"H6440\"whom|strong=\"H6440\"you|strong=\"H6440\"made|strong=\"H8313\"strong for|strong=\"H6440\"yourself.   \n"},{"number":18,"text":"So|strong=\"H1961\"we|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H1961\"not|strong=\"H1961\"turn|strong=\"H1961\"away from|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H5921\".  \nRevive us|strong=\"H5921\", and|strong=\"H1121\"we|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H1961\"call on|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"name.   \n"},{"number":19,"text":"Turn|strong=\"H5472\"us|strong=\"H2421\"again, LORD|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H3808\"of|strong=\"H8034\"Armies|strong=\"H3808\".  \nCause|strong=\"H7121\"your|strong=\"H4480\"face to|strong=\"H7121\"shine, and|strong=\"H2421\"we|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3808\"be|strong=\"H3808\"saved|strong=\"H2421\".   \n"}]}
